{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvb13RPMW8W4xBAsJVDu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: plan to sunset the integration by default, and only rebuild if the four accounts turn out to be worth it.** Interviews can help, but they shouldn't be what decides this.\n\n**The numbers favour sunsetting.** 4 of 3,100 accounts is about 0.13% of the base. A rebuild takes roughly 30 engineer-days. Keeping the current version alive already costs about 24 engineer-days a year, and a new integration will need upkeep too. Unless those four accounts are unusually valuable, the rebuild won't pay for itself.\n\n**Interviews answer the wrong question.** If you ask customers \"should we rebuild this?\", they'll almost always say yes, because it costs them nothing. Your own data answers the real question faster:\n- What revenue do the four accounts bring in, and when do their contracts renew?\n- Do their contracts promise this integration?\n- How heavily do they use it: daily workflows or the odd sync?\n- Are they also using another supported email provider?\n\n**Suggested plan:**\n1. **This week:** pull that data. If together the accounts are worth well over the rebuild cost, or one is strategically important, consider rebuilding. Otherwise, sunset.\n2. **Talk to the four accounts about moving, not about whether to rebuild.** Find out what they rely on and offer a path: a supported provider, a generic IMAP/SMTP option, or a middleware tool like Zapier. Hands-on migration help is far cheaper than six weeks of engineering.\n3. **Decide within about 3–4 weeks.** Customers need roughly 90 days' notice before the shutdown, and if you do rebuild, it needs a buffer before the provider's deadline.\n4. **If you sunset,** stop the monthly upkeep once everyone has moved instead of carrying it to the deadline.\n\nThe real risk isn't picking wrong. It's spending months gathering opinions until the deadline decides for you."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3191,"cache_read_input_tokens":5019,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3191},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a2718617-124b-4c30-810b-fa9a82a55eac","uuid":"84af17e7-4830-4c1f-b30c-d9aadf1774dd","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:12:58.420Z","request_id":"req_011Cfvb13AWwRAWr8bqMuhZR"}
